     "name": "Anthropic account"
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "promptType": "define",
    "text": "={{ $json.query }}",
    "options": {
     "systemMessage": "=You are the Concepter, an editorial agent. You receive one article that passed relevance filtering. Decide if a clean editorial concept exists. If yes, write it. If not, output silence.\n\nRULES:\n1. ONE concept, ONE angle. No variants. Can't commit \u2192 silence.\n2. Silence is legitimate. No clean angle \u2192 output {\"silence\": true}.\n3. Check pruned list. Same article/topic already dropped \u2192 silence.\n4. LITERAL QUOTE ALIGNMENT: cite ONE priority phrase using user's exact words in quotation marks. No quote fits \u2192 silence.\n5. Newspaper-column voice. 60-100 words for concept_body.\n6. Three beats: headline (one editorial line), concept_body (60-100 words arguing the angle), alignment (literal quote + why).\n7. No CTA. No \"audit this\" or \"write about this.\"\n8. Respect allergies from priorities doc.\n9. Write in user's register but never write user's opinions for them.\n10. Never sound like AI. Ban: \"fascinating insight,\" \"it's interesting to note,\" \"in today's fast-paced landscape,\" \"leveraging,\" \"unlock.\"\n\nPRIORITIES DOC:\n{{ $json.priorities }}\n\nPRUNED LIST (recently dropped concepts from this source):\n{{ $json.prunedList }}\n\nRADAR'S RATIONALE FOR PASSING THIS ARTICLE:\nPriority match: {{ $json.matched_priority }}\nRationale: {{ $json.rationale }}\n\nOUTPUT \u2014 valid JSON only, no code fences:\nConcept: {\"headline\": \"editorial framing, one line\", \"concept_body\": \"60-100 words, newspaper voice\", \"alignment_quote\": \"literal phrase from priorities doc\", \"alignment_priority\": \"which priority line\", \"alignment_why\": \"one sentence\"}\nSilence: {\"silence\": true}"
    }
   },
   "id": "4b930bac-517e-4d94-956c-42e76ff878c0",
   "name": "Concepter Agent",
   "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
   "typeVersion": 3,
   "position": [
    -656,
    80
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "jsCode": "let raw = $input.first().json.output;\nconst prev = $('Build Context').first().json;\n\nlet parsed;\nif (typeof raw === 'object' && raw !== null) {\n  parsed = raw;\n} else {\n  let text = String(raw || '').trim();\n  text = text.replace(/^```(?:json)?\\s*\\n?/, '').replace(/\\n?\\s*```\\s*$/, '').trim();\n  try {\n    parsed = JSON.parse(text);\n  } catch (e) {\n    const match = text.match(/\\{[\\s\\S]*\"(?:headline|silence)\"[\\s\\S]*\\}$/);\n    if (match) {\n      try { parsed = JSON.parse(match[0]); } catch (e2) { parsed = null; }\n    }\n    if (!parsed) {\n      parsed = { silence: true };\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nreturn [{ json: { ...prev, ...parsed, hasConcept: !parsed.silence && !!parsed.headline } }];"
   },
   "id": "c76b9b5b-2d4c-48d7-be32-62194ebb12ee",
